{
  "name": "n8n Hardening: Validate, Retry, Fallback, Log, Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - VALIDATE BEFORE ANYTHING ELSE RUNS\n\nA bad record is rejected here with the exact field that is wrong, instead of blowing up three API calls later.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1a107a7c-4524-5045-a599-3e8ed4fffc7a",
      "name": "Section - 1 - VALIDATE BEFORE ANYTHING ELSE RUNS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - CALL SYSTEM A, RETRY ON FAILURE\n\nA failed call waits and tries again rather than killing the run. The retry count is a setting, not a guess.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "302408e8-c6c6-5975-874b-cd91a9de4863",
      "name": "Section - 2 - CALL SYSTEM A, RETRY ON FAILURE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - FALLBACK WHEN IT KEEPS FAILING\n\nOnce retries are used up the record is queued for manual retry. Nothing is ever dropped on the floor.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b4603ee4-ddcf-54f9-995a-c345818776e9",
      "name": "Section - 3 - FALLBACK WHEN IT KEEPS FAILING",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2140,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - MAP THE FIELDS AND WRITE TO SYSTEM B\n\nOne place where field names are translated between the two systems, so a change is a one line edit.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0728fec1-6bf0-5bc5-9d4e-4ef68fba6bb7",
